From fc0e38d2904b05d7c980aeaac85b61a67de53393 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthias Beckert <matthias.beckert@elektrobit.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 07:27:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Use correct gitignore pattern. Excluding build* causes
 loosing a lot files (named, build*) when creating a new repo from scratch.

---
 .gitignore | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index fff155f1..68b555e8 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -3,4 +3,5 @@
 __pycache__
 .config.yaml*
 .kas_shell_history
-build*
+/build/
+/build-*/
-- 
2.47.3
